# Original project faction names and descriptions.
ra2-modern-yemen-name = Yemen
ra2-modern-yemen-description = Dispersed coastal defense: 12 Yemeni units and three concealed
    defenses. Cheap ambushers, guided rockets, one-way drones and linked
    boats; avoid long exposed trades with heavy armor.

ra2-r2ymr-name = Mountain Rifleman
ra2-r2ymr-description = Inexpensive two-shot ambush infantry. Camouflages while
    stationary; firing, moving or damage reveals him.
    Weak vs armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2yrpg-name = RPG Hunter
ra2-r2yrpg-description = Short-range anti-armor rockets. Near a Drone Spotter: +20%
    range and 20% faster reloads.
    Weak vs infantry and aircraft.

ra2-r2yspot-name = Drone Spotter
ra2-r2yspot-description = Long sight and cloak detection. Guides nearby RPG Hunters and
    missile trucks; guidance does not stack.
    Weak carbine; requires radar.

ra2-r2wadighost-name = Wadi Ghost
ra2-r2wadighost-description = Infiltrator who stays camouflaged while moving. Suppressed
    double-tap, C4 and a remote charge that detonates on
    structures after 3 seconds. Maximum one.

ra2-r2technical-name = Armed Technical
ra2-r2technical-description = Fast, cheap machine-gun raider. Strong vs infantry;
    very weak vs armor. Strike exposed targets and relocate.

ra2-r2ytechrr-name = Recoilless Technical
ra2-r2ytechrr-description = Fast pickup with a recoilless anti-armor rifle.
    Hits hard but has almost no armor.

ra2-r2yzu-name = ZU-23 Technical
ra2-r2yzu-description = Mobile twin-cannon air defense. Cannot attack ground targets.
    Light armor.

ra2-r2ymlr-name = Mobile Missile Launcher
ra2-r2ymlr-description = Long-range missile truck with a 5-cell minimum range. The empty
    erector shows the long reload. Drone guidance extends range and
    shortens reloads. Requires radar.

ra2-r2samad-name = Samad Drone
ra2-r2samad-description = One-way loitering munition. Consumed by its terminal dive;
    strongest vs structures. Vulnerable to anti-air. Requires radar.

ra2-r2hodeidah-name = Hodeidah Missile Craft
ra2-r2hodeidah-description = Anti-ship and coastal missiles; turns to fire. Firing reveals
    it for 8 seconds. Surveillance links add 20% range and
    12% damage. Requires radar.

ra2-r2sahaab-name = Sahaab USV
ra2-r2sahaab-description = Cheap explosive surface drone, destroyed by its attack.
    Moves only inside a surveillance link or shipyard relay.
    Vulnerable to fast patrol craft.

ra2-r2mokha-name = Mokha Surveillance Craft
ra2-r2mokha-description = Links USVs and coordinates missile fire within 6 cells.
    Deploy active radar for a 14-cell link and wider sensors;
    emission reveals it. Detects submarines. Requires radar.

ra2-r2ybunker-name = Mountain Bunker
ra2-r2ybunker-description = Camouflaged machine-gun nest; firing or damage reveals it.
    Requires power. Weak vs armor.

ra2-r2yzunest-name = ZU-23 Nest
ra2-r2yzunest-description = Twin-cannon air defense. Cannot attack ground targets.
    Requires radar and power.

ra2-r2ycoastal-name = Coastal Missile Battery
ra2-r2ycoastal-description = Camouflaged anti-ship and anti-vehicle missiles. Minimum
    range: 3 cells. Surveillance links add range.
    Requires radar and power.
